  <p id="c-nanshi-058-peisui-hui:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-058-peisui-hui:p001:m0000" ref="vtp_lo9_0af">裴邃</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peisui-hui:p001:m0003" ref="vtp_lo9_0af">深明</persName>，河東聞喜人，魏冀州刺史<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peisui-hui:p001:m0017" ref="047_850_e7d">徽</persName>之後也。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peisui-hui:p001:m0023" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo">壽孫</persName>，寓居壽陽，為<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peisui-hui:p001:m0032" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA">宋武帝</persName>前軍長史。父<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peisui-hui:p001:m0041" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_A">仲穆</persName>，驍騎將軍。</p>
